{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31460","headline":"别狄佩 · 李羣玉","name":"别狄佩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠竹不着花，凤雏长忍饥。\n未开丹霄翮，空把碧梧枝。\n圣人奏云韶，祥凤一来仪。\n文章耀白日，衆鸟莫敢窥。\n郁抑不自言，凡鸟何由知。\n当看九千仞，飞出太平时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}